# Settings in tabs: each says what it sets, and a choice lists every
# value with what it does.
Output landing/public/media/settings.mp4
Output landing/public/media/settings.webm
Source demo/tapes/setup.tape

Show
Sleep 1s
Type ","
Sleep 1.8s
Set TypingSpeed 900ms
Type "ll"
Sleep 1.2s
Set TypingSpeed 500ms
Type "j"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Set TypingSpeed 900ms
Type "l"
Sleep 2s
